iv>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"top\":{\"color\":\"var:preset|color|accent-6\",\"width\":\"1px\"}},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"border-top-color:var(--wp--preset--color--accent-6);border-top-width:1px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Are signed copies available?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This exquisite compilation showcases a diverse array of photographs that capture the essence of different eras and cultures, reflecting the unique styles and perspectives of each artist.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"aside\",\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"is-style-section-3\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}},\"dimensions\":{\"minHeight\":\"\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"800px\"}} -->\n<aside class=\"wp-block-group alignfull is-style-section-3\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"dimensions\":{\"minHeight\":\"360px\"},\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\",\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"min-height:360px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"xx-large\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-xx-large-font-size\">Sign up to get daily stories</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"is-style-text-subtitle\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center is-style-text-subtitle\">Get access to a curated collection of moments in time featuring photographs from historical relevance.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"0px\",\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"flexSize\":\"20px\",\"selfStretch\":\"fixed\"}}} -->\n<div style=\"height:0px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-text-align-center wp-element-button\">Subscribe</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></aside>\n<!-- /wp:group -->', 'About Us', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '14-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-04-18 12:55:53', '2026-04-18 12:55:53', '', 14, 'http://localhost/shoe_store/?p=18', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(20, 1, '2026-04-26 23:51:51', '2026-04-26 23:51:51', 'The Nike Air Max 270 delivers visible cushioning under every step. The large Air unit provides a super-soft ride that feels as good as it looks. Features a breathable mesh upper and foam midsole for lightweight comfort.', 'Nike Air Max 270 - Black/White', 'Iconic Nike Air Max 270 with large Air unit for all-day comfort.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'nike-air-max-270-black-white', '', '', '2026-04-26 23:51:59', '2026-04-26 23:51:59', '', 0, 'http://localhost/shoe_store/?post_type=product&#038;p=20', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(22, 1, '2026-04-26 23:51:52', '2026-04-26 23:51:52', 'The Nike Air Force 1 Low is a basketball icon turned streetwear staple. Featuring a durable leather upper and full-length Air-Sole unit, this shoe is built to last and looks great with any outfit.', 'Nike Air Force 1 Low - White', 'Classic Nike Air Force 1 Low in clean all-white colorway.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'nike-air-force-1-low-white', '', '', '2026-04-26 23:52:00', '2026-04-26 23:52:00', '', 0, 'http://localhost/shoe_store/?post_type=product&#038;p=22', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(23, 1, '2026-04-26 23:51:53', '2026-04-26 23:51:53', 'The Air Jordan 1 Retro High OG Chicago brings back one of the most beloved colorways in sneaker history. Features premium leather upper, Air-Sole cushioning, and the iconic Wings logo on the ankle collar.', 'Jordan 1 Retro High OG - Chicago', 'The iconic Air Jordan 1 High in the legendary Chicago colorway.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'jordan-1-retro-high-og-chicago', '', '', '2026-04-26 23:52:00', '2026-04-26 23:52:00', '', 0, 'http://localhost/shoe_store/?post_type=product&#038;p=23', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(24, 1, '2026-04-26 23:51:53', '2026-04-26 23:51:53', 'Run in unbelievable comfort with the Adidas Ultraboost 22. Featuring a Primeknit+ upper that adapts to your foot, a full-length BOOST midsole for energy return, and a Continental Rubber outsole for great grip.', 'Adidas Ultraboost 22 - Core Black', 'Adidas Ultraboost 22 with responsive BOOST midsole for ultimate energy return.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'adidas-ultraboost-22-core-black', '', '', '2026-04-26 23:52:01', '2026-04-26 23:52:01', '', 0, 'http://localhost/shoe_store/?post_type=product&#038;p=24', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(25, 1, '2026-04-26 23:51:54', '2026-04-26 23:51:54', 'Originally a tennis shoe, the Adidas Stan Smith has become one of the most iconic sneakers of all time. Features a clean leather upper, perforated 3-Stripes, and a cupsole construction.', 'Adidas Stan Smith - White/Green', 'The timeless Adidas Stan Smith tennis shoe turned fashion icon.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'adidas-stan-smith-white-green', '', '', '2026-04-26 23:52:02', '2026-04-26 23:52:02', '', 0, 'http://localhost/shoe_store/?post_type=product&#038;p=25', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(26, 1, '2026-04-26 23:51:54', '2026-04-26 23:51:54', 'The Nike React Infinity Run Flyknit 3 is designed to keep you on the run. An updated Flyknit upper adds structure where you need it most, while React foam cushioning keeps you comfortable mile after mile.', 'Nike React Infinity Run Flyknit 3', 'Nike\'s most injury-free shoe for runners, now with updated Flyknit upper.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'nike-react-infinity-run-flyknit-3', '', '', '2026-04-26 23:52:03', '2026-04-26 23:52:03', '', 0, 'http://localhost/shoe_store/?post_type=product&#038;p=26', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(27, 1, '2026-04-26 23:51:54', '2026-04-26 23:51:54', 'The ASICS Gel-Nimbus 25 is our most plush neutral running shoe. FF BLAST PLUS ECO cushioning delivers a lightweight, high-rebound ride, while our GEL technology absorbs shock in the rearfoot and forefoot.', 'ASICS Gel-Nimbus 25', 'Premium ASICS running shoe with GEL technology for ultimate cushioning.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'asics-gel-nimbus-25', '', '', '2026-04-26 23:52:03', '2026-04-26 23:52:03', '', 0, 'http://localhost/shoe_store/?post_type=product&#038;p=27', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(28, 1, '2026-04-26 23:51:54', '2026-04-26 23:51:54', 'The Timberland 6-inch Premium Waterproof Boot is an icon of rugged, outdoor footwear. Features waterproof full-grain leather, seam-sealed construction, padded collar, and lug outsole for superior traction.', 'Timberland 6-Inch Premium Waterproof Boot - Wheat', 'The iconic Timberland boot that started it all. Waterproof and built to last.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'timberland-6-inch-premium-waterproof-boot-wheat', '', '', '2026-04-26 23:52:04', '2026-04-26 23:52:04', '', 0, 'http://localhost/shoe_store/?post_type=product&#038;p=28', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(29, 1, '2026-04-26 23:51:55', '2026-04-26 23:51:55', 'The Dr. Martens 1460 is the original boot that launched a cultural icon. Features smooth leather upper, grooved sides, heel-loop, and the signature air-cushioned sole with yellow welt stitching.', 'Dr. Martens 1460 Original 8-Eye Boot - Black', 'The original Dr. Martens boot with iconic air-cushioned sole and yellow stitching.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'dr-martens-1460-original-8-eye-boot-black', '', '', '2026-04-26 23:52:05', '2026-04-26 23:52:05', '', 0, 'http://localhost/shoe_store/?post_type=product&#038;p=29', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(30, 1, '2026-04-26 23:51:55', '2026-04-26 23:51:55', 'The Gucci Horsebit loafer is a timeless piece of Italian craftsmanship. Featuring polished calf leather upper, the iconic Horsebit hardware in gold-tone metal, and a leather-wrapped heel.', 'Gucci Horsebit Loafer - Black Leather', 'Iconic Gucci Horsebit loafer in polished black leather with gold hardware.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'gucci-horsebit-loafer-black-leather', '', '', '2026-04-26 23:52:05', '2026-04-26 23:52:05', '', 0, 'http://localhost/shoe_store/?post_type=product&#038;p=30', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(31, 1, '2026-04-26 23:51:55', '2026-04-26 23:51:55', 'The Clarks Desert Boot is one of the most iconic shoes ever made. Created by Nathan Clark in 1950, this ankle boot features a two-eyelet lace-up closure, crepe sole, and unlined suede or leather upper.', 'Clarks Originals Desert Boot - Beeswax Leather', 'The Clarks Desert Boot - a must-have wardrobe essential since 1950.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'clarks-originals-desert-boot-beeswax-leather', '', '', '2026-04-26 23:52:06', '2026-04-26 23:52:06', '', 0, 'http://localhost/shoe_store/?post_type=product&#038;p=31', 0, 'product', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(32, 1, '2026-04-26 23:51:56', '2026-04-26 23:51:56', 'The Vans Classic Slip-On is a simple, low-profile sneaker with a canvas upper, elastic side accents for a snug fit, and the original Vans rubber waffle outsole. The checkerboard is a Vans icon.', 'Vans Classic Slip-On - Black/White Checkerboard', 'The Vans Slip-On in the iconic black and white checkerboard print.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'vans-classic-slip-on-black-white-checkerboard', '', '', '2026-04-26 23:52:07', '2026-04-26 23:52:07', '', 0, 'http://localhost/shoe_store/?post_type=product&#038;p=32', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(33, 1, '2026-04-26 23:51:56', '2026-04-26 23:51:56', 'The New Balance 574 is a timeless sneaker that has been a favourite since its debut. Features a suede and mesh upper, ENCAP midsole for support and durability, and a rubber outsole for lasting wear.', 'New Balance 574 Core - Grey', 'New Balance 574 - the classic sneaker with ENCAP midsole technology.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'new-balance-574-core-grey', '', '', '2026-04-26 23:52:07', '2026-04-26 23:52:07', '', 0, 'http://localhost/shoe_store/?post_type=product&#038;p=33', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(34, 1, '2026-04-26 23:51:56', '2026-04-26 23:51:56', 'The Birkenstock Arizona is the brand\'s most iconic style. Features two adjustable buckle straps, a contoured cork and latex footbed that moulds to your foot, and a durable EVA outsole.', 'Birkenstock Arizona - Soft Footbed Sandal', 'Classic Birkenstock two-strap sandal with contoured cork footbed.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'birkenstock-arizona-soft-footbed-sandal', '', '', '2026-04-26 23:52:08', '2026-04-26 23:52:08', '', 0, 'http://localhost/shoe_store/?post_type=product&#038;p=34', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(35, 1, '2026-04-26 23:51:57', '2026-04-26 23:51:57', 'The UA HOVR Phantom 3 gives you a \'zero gravity feel\' to maintain energy return and help eliminate impact. The connected version records your run stats automatically, syncing to the MapMyRun app.', 'Under Armour HOVR Phantom 3 - Black', 'Under Armour\'s most connected shoe with HOVR technology for zero gravity feel.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'under-armour-hovr-phantom-3-black', '', '', '2026-04-26 23:52:09', '2026-04-26 23:52:09', '', 0, 'http://localhost/shoe_store/?post_type=product&#038;p=35', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(36, 1, '2026-04-26 23:51:57', '2026-04-26 23:51:57', 'The Nike Revolution 6 is designed to support young athletes\' active lifestyles. Features a foam midsole for soft cushioning, rubber outsole for traction, and an easy slip-on/off design perfect for kids.', 'Nike Revolution 6 - Kids (Little Kids)', 'Lightweight and durable Nike kids\' running shoe for everyday adventures.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'nike-revolution-6-kids-little-kids', '', '', '2026-04-26 23:52:09', '2026-04-26 23:52:09', '', 0, 'http://localhost/shoe_store/?post_type=product&#038;p=36', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(37, 1, '2026-04-26 23:51:57', '2026-04-26 23:51:57', 'The Adidas Tensaur Run 2.0 keeps young runners comfortable on the track. A mesh upper provides breathability, while the Tensaur outsole and lightweight cushioning makes every step comfortable.', 'Adidas Tensaur Run 2.0 - Kids', 'Supportive and comfortable Adidas trainers designed for active kids.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'adidas-tensaur-run-2-0-kids', '', '', '2026-04-26 23:52:10', '2026-04-26 23:52:10', '', 0, 'http://localhost/shoe_store/?post_type=product&#038;p=37', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(38, 1, '2026-04-26 23:51:58', '2026-04-26 23:51:58', 'The Steve Madden Irenee pump features a sleek pointed toe, stiletto heel, and smooth patent leather upper. A wardrobe staple that pairs perfectly with everything from jeans to evening wear.', 'Steve Madden Irenee Pump - Nude', 'Classic pointed-toe Steve Madden pump in versatile nude patent leather.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'steve-madden-irenee-pump-nude', '', '', '2026-04-26 23:52:10', '2026-04-26 23:52:10', '', 0, 'http://localhost/shoe_store/?post_type=product&#038;p=38', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(39, 1, '2026-04-26 23:51:58', '2026-04-26 23:51:58', 'The Sam Edelman Penny ankle boot is a closet essential. Features supple leather upper, a 1.5-inch stacked heel, inside zip closure, and a lug-style rubber outsole for all-day wear.', 'Sam Edelman Penny Ankle Boot - Black Leather', 'Versatile Sam Edelman ankle boot in classic black leather with stacked heel.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'sam-edelman-penny-ankle-boot-black-leather', '', '', '2026-04-26 23:52:11', '2026-04-26 23:52:11', '', 0, 'http://localhost/shoe_store/?post_type=product&#038;p=39', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(40, 1, '2026-04-26 23:51:58', '2026-04-26 23:51:58', 'The UGG Classic Mini II Boot is a fan favourite. Features Twinface sheepskin upper, suede heel guard, UGGpure wool insole, and a lightweight EVA outsole. Perfect for keeping feet warm and comfortable.', 'UGG Classic Mini II Boot - Chestnut', 'The iconic UGG Mini boot with Twinface sheepskin and suede heel guard.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'ugg-classic-mini-ii-boot-chestnut', '', '', '2026-04-26 23:52:12', '2026-04-26 23:52:12', '', 0, 'http://localhost/shoe_store/?post_type=product&#038;p=40', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(41, 1, '2026-04-30 01:30:32', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 'Auto Draft', '', 'auto-draft', 'open', 'open', '', '', '', '', '2026-04-30 01:30:32', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 0, 'http://localhost/shoe_store/?p=41', 0, 'post', '', 0),
(42, 1, '2026-04-30 01:39:22', '2026-04-30 01:39:22', '', 'logo', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', 'logo', '', '', '2026-04-30 01:39:22', '2026-04-30 01:39:22', '', 0, 'http://localhost/shoe_store/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/logo.png', 0, 'attachment', 'image/png', 0);
